/-!
# Graph invariance under packed generator B

The 23 stages rearrange the bits of a whole graph row. The coordinate checks
certify the exact packed point map, and the row checks certify its action on
every row of `GraphData`. `BitNetwork.sound` connects these two certificates.
All checks are kernel reductions, in bounded batches of at most 256 points.
The source data are ATLAS F22G1-p3510B0 (GLS3 Table 5.3t); the masks can be
regenerated by `source/generate_certificates.py`.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.Fischer.Fi22.KernelCertificate

